# VyaaparKitaab Frontend Environment Configuration

# Backend API Base URL
# - For local development: leave blank or set to http://localhost:8000
# - For Vercel demo with tunnel (Cloudflare Tunnel / ngrok): e.g. https://tunnel-id.trycloudflare.com
# - For Vercel production with hosted backend (Render / Azure / Railway): e.g. https://vyaaparkitaab-api.onrender.com
